      "sentence_id": 5,
      "text": "Heard Sri Varun Ojha, Advocate, holding brief of Sri Sushil Kumar Shukla, learned counsel for the revisionist, Sri Jitendra Singh, learned A.G.A. for the State and perused the record.\n3.",
