        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 6,
      "text": "The present revision has been filed by the revisionist Shaukat Ali against the impugned judgement and order dated 30.08.2018 passed by Ist Additional Sessions Judge, Baghpat in Criminal Appeal No. 36 of 2011, Shaukat Ali vs. State of U.P. and others, and the impugned judgement and order dated 14.11.2011 passed by the Additional Chief Judicial Magistrate, Baghpat in Criminal Case No. 1143 of 2008, State of U.P. vs. Shaukat Ali, under Section 7/16 Prevention of Food Adulteration Act, by which both the courts found guilty and convicted the revisionist for imprisonment of 6 months simple imprisonment and fine of Rs.2000/- and in default of payment of fine, one month additional imprisonment.\n4.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
